        <mxCell id="nb4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Inter-SAE commands&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every command except ping needs a known caller, identified by its pinned certificate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lock client pair&lt;/b&gt;: a 5-minute lease in the caller&#39;s name; only the holder renews or releases it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Store keys from peer&lt;/b&gt;: only for the caller&#39;s own share and only while the caller holds the lock; the keys come from this SAE&#39;s own KME and are stored in one step, otherwise refused.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Delete stored keys&lt;/b&gt;: only under the caller&#39;s lock and only if the share is still the one the caller saw (another SAE may delete when a device moves; logged).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Read share status&lt;/b&gt;: any known caller.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ping&lt;/b&gt;: no caller check" vertex="1">
